{"results":[{"url":"https://www.nbcnews.com/politics/2026-election/election-officials-debunk-persistent-false-claim-poll-workers-ballots-rcna603676","final_url":"https://www.nbcnews.com/politics/2026-election/election-officials-debunk-persistent-false-claim-poll-workers-ballots-rcna603676","title":"Election officials debunk a persistent false claim about poll workers and ballots","description":"From Florida to Illinois to New Mexico, state and local officials are aggressively targeting misinformation online to prevent confusion with midterm voting underway.","language":"en","text":"Election officials across the country this week went out of their way to publicly debunk years-old conspiracy theories that have circulated online about poll workers writing on ballots.\n\n### FOR SUBSCRIBERSVoters want the Iran war to end. It’s not that easy.\n\n### FOR SUBSCRIBERSAre we approaching a new era of Alzheimer’s prevention?\n\n### FOR SUBSCRIBERSVoters want the Iran war to end. It’s not that easy.\n\n### FOR SUBSCRIBERSAre we approaching a new era of Alzheimer’s prevention?\n\nJust a moment.\n\nWe are getting your experience ready.","author":"Jane C. Timm","published_date":"2026-10-15T20:20:47.315Z","latency_ms":1879.0541549999489,"format":"markdown"}],"errors":[]}